{% layout 'layouts/page' %}

<h1 class="huge">{{ heading }}</h1>
<p>{{ intro }}</p>
<section class="zodiac-intro">
  <h3>{{ calc_heading }}</h3>
  <blockquote class="quote">
    {{ quote }}
  </blockquote>
  <p>
    To divine one's Alchemical Sign, take the day of thy birth and
    <em>reduce it to a single digit by summing its parts.</em>
    Shouldst thou be born on the 12th October 1875, thou shalt perform:
  </p>
  <p>1 + 2 + 1 + 0 + 1 + 8 + 7 + 5 = 25 = 2 + 5 =
    <em>7</em>
  </p>
  <p>
    If this sacred sum results ends in
    <em>zero</em>
    and above the 10th,              
            consider it
    <em>10</em>, the sacred number of unity in duality.
  </p>
  <p>
    This final digit reveals thy
    <em>elemental dominion</em>, drawn from              
            the mystic wheel of ten sacred alchemical signs.
  </p>
</section>
<section class="signs" data-js="hashopen">
  <ul>
    {% for sign in signs %}
      <details class="sign" id="{{sign.id}}">
        <summary class="sign-name">{{ sign.name }}</summary>
        <p>
          {{ sign.description }}
        </p>
      </details>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
<button class="button" onclick="self.close()">Close</button>